    "updated_at": "2019-09-24T00:23:08Z",
    "body": "NVM is _really_ slow, and we haven't written any special logic for it. Much faster than `node --version` when using nvm is running `nvm current` (which is why that's what [spaceship does](https://github.com/denysdovhan/spaceship-prompt/blob/master/sections/node.zsh#L31-L32)). If anyone wants to tackle this, PRs are welcome! 😄 \r\n\r\nThis should, however, be addressed by per-binary caching, which we hope to implement as part of #232. ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
