    "body": "> The main \"issue\" of Powerlevel10k is that it's zsh-specific.\r\n\r\nBy all means, use other shells and other themes. I'm not going to dissuade you. I like zsh and powerlevel10k and nothing prevents me from using them. Other people have different preferences and/or constraints.\r\n\r\n> My dream would be if the different leading projects (i.e. Powerlevel10k, Starship, Pure) could merge one day in a semi-native way.\r\n\r\nWhy would it be good? Isn't it nice to have a choice of operating systems, shells, terminals and themes?\r\n\r\nAlso, what do you think Pure has that Powerlevel10k doesn't?\r\n",
