    "updated_at": "2020-01-12T19:53:37Z",
    "body": "> @romkatv Thanks for mentioning zsh-defer, I didn't know about it!\r\n\r\nIt's pretty good. If you cannot or don't want to use powerlevel10k, this is the next best tool for speeding up zsh startup. Super easy to use, too.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\n```zsh\r\nsource \"$NVM_DIR/nvm.sh\"  # slooow 🐌 \r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\n```zsh\r\nzsh-defer source \"$NVM_DIR/nvm.sh\"  # fast 🚀 \r\n```\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/starship/starship/issues/comments/573450759/reactions",
